OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind' man named as deceased in
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a "kind and generous" man
OL,7,Ffound dead in woodland last week have
OL,8,Fpaid tribute to him as a murder
OL,9,Finvestigation continues round his
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,FWiltshire Police said Graham Pennycook,
OL,13,F64, was found dead in woods in
OL,14,FLudgershall, and after a post mortem,
OL,15,Fhis death was treated as suspicious.
OL,17,FHis wife Jacky has described him as
OL,18,F"solid and dependable", adding: "He was
OL,19,Fa pillar of strength, trusted by all
OL,20,Fand always on hand to help family and
OL,21,Ffriends whenever needed."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
