OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind' man named as deceased in
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnyone who was in the polo fields and
OL,7,Fsurrounding woodland near to Perham
OL,8,FDown and may have seen anything "out of
OL,9,Fthe ordinary" on 24 September is asked
OL,10,Fcontact the police.
